<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Mar 05.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Mar 05.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to West Norfolk Apr/Jun 102.50</p>
<p>Norfolk Apr/Jun 102.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Mar 99.50/100.00 Apr 101.00</p>
<p>Avon range Mar 98.50 Apr/Jun 102.50</p>
<p>Liverpool Mar 100.00 Apr/Jun 103.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Apr/Jun 99.00</p>
</text>
